                <a class="mega-link has-plus" href="/services/build-a-new-ipl"><div><span class="mega-link-title">Build a New IPL</span><span class="mega-link-desc">Product Design / Prototyping / At Scale</span></div><span class="mega-plus">+</span></a>
                <a class="mega-link has-plus" href="/services/maintain-or-fix-ipl-project"><div><span class="mega-link-title">Maintain or Fix My IPL</span><span class="mega-link-desc">Energy, flash speed and upgrade</span></div><span class="mega-plus">+</span></a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mega-right">
              <div class="mega-services">
                <span class="mega-services-heading">Manufacturing Services</span>
